</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Don’t worry — the game includes multiple <strong>checkpoints</strong>, so if you fall, you can try again from a safe spot without starting over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗💨 <strong>Check out the GIFs below</strong> to see these mechanics in action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Checkpoint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/4c2b873855a3ee908d020e726af5dccd.poster.avif?t=1757339011\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/4c2b873855a3ee908d020e726af5dccd.webm?t=1757339011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/4c2b873855a3ee908d020e726af5dccd.mp4?t=1757339011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>✔️ <strong>Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/60d9b085fb06f48526d9df760b282b0a.poster.avif?t=1757339011\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/60d9b085fb06f48526d9df760b282b0a.webm?t=1757339011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/60d9b085fb06f48526d9df760b282b0a.mp4?t=1757339011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Jump + Impulse Left</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/aadc23724e0e2c2f57160075ac927bb7.poster.avif?t=1757339